><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">3<span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ✓</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><span class=\"katex\" role=\"math\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">a3=5(9)−6(3)=27=33a_3 = 5(9) &#8211; 6(3) = 27 = 3^3 </span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">3<span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ✓</li>\n</ul>\n"
